{"3914410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yeet Up!", "steam_appid": 3914410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>About This Game</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeet Up! is a challenging, fast-paced vertical platformer where you control a spherical character armed with a grappling hook. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to climb as high as possible through an endless world filled with challenging platforms and tricky obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Mechanics</strong>: Swing, latch, and yeet your way upwards with fluid and responsive controls. Mastering the grappling hook is key to gaining momentum and reaching new heights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Vertical Climbing:</strong> No two runs are the same! Procedurally generated platforms and dynamic obstacles keep the challenge fresh and your reflexes sharp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Movement:</strong> Satisfying momentum and weight as you propel your character through the air. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard Competition:</strong> Compete against players worldwide to earn the highest score and claim your spot on the global leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple but Challenging:</strong> Easy to pick up, hard to master. Whether you’re a casual player or a competitive gamer, Yeet Up! offers a rewarding experience for all skill levels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Visual Style:</strong> Enjoy bright, colorful, and playful graphics that match the game’s energetic vibe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Play Sessions:</strong> Perfect for short bursts of gameplay — jump in, climb high, and beat your best score anytime you want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914410/extras/9d26767b746802a5ee62512a5a4a6130.poster.avif?t=1755279848\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914410/extras/9d26767b746802a5ee62512a5a4a6130.webm?t=1755279848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914410/extras/9d26767b746802a5ee62512a5a4a6130.mp4?t=1755279848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>About This Game</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeet Up! is a challenging, fast-paced vertical platformer where you control a spherical character armed with a grappling hook. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to climb as high as possible through an endless world filled with challenging platforms and tricky obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Mechanics</strong>: Swing, latch, and yeet your way upwards with fluid and responsive controls. Mastering the grappling hook is key to gaining momentum and reaching new heights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Vertical Climbing:</strong> No two runs are the same! Procedurally generated platforms and dynamic obstacles keep the challenge fresh and your reflexes sharp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Movement:</strong> Satisfying momentum and weight as you propel your character through the air. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard Competition:</strong> Compete against players worldwide to earn the highest score and claim your spot on the global leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple but Challenging:</strong> Easy to pick up, hard to master. Whether you’re a casual player or a competitive gamer, Yeet Up! offers a rewarding experience for all skill levels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Visual Style:</strong> Enjoy bright, colorful, and playful graphics that match the game’s energetic vibe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Play Sessions:</strong> Perfect for short bursts of gameplay — jump in, climb high, and beat your best score anytime you want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914410/extras/9d26767b746802a5ee62512a5a4a6130.poster.avif?t=1755279848\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914410/extras/9d26767b746802a5ee62512a5a4a6130.webm?t=1755279848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914410/extras/9d26767b746802a5ee62512a5a4a6130.mp4?t=1755279848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Yeet Up! is a challenging 2D physics platformer where you control a spherical character using a grappling hook. Swing with precision, dodge tricky obstacles, and climb as high as you can to claim the #1 spot on the global leaderboard!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Arabic, Catalan", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914410/86dbaf567cb243f1d2a761547e0e25553b3ed487/header.jpg?t=1755279848", "capsule_image": "https://sha